    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/7b3ec08d0f719b35f03afa1eccb87480.webp?t=1685540023\" /></div><br>Super Nate Adventure is a game about focused, tight platforming through challenging levels. Each new level with a different obstacle than the last, encountering new areas and new enemies to face along the way. The game has <strong>12 levels</strong> that span across <strong>3 unique worlds</strong> which have different sceneries, music and obstacles. Diamonds are placed throughout the world to guide you through each level, but keys are an extra difficult challenge usually requiring more work to obtain.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/6aecaf014f69c0b73674cc1549921f9c.webp?t=1685540023\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Full controller support. Automatically detects connected controllers.</h2><br><br><table><tr><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/ac59f6a6a6965710496ed38ec82bf262.avif?t=1685540023\" /></div></td><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/841dfa0fe03b96f5c66a1c445a5bf485.avif?t=1685540023\" /></div></td><td>Press to <strong>Jump</strong> or hold for a <strong>High Jump</strong>.</td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/d082d80ccfef1729d3fc935e05af992c.avif?t=1685540023\" /></div></td><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/127c01a755c2dcfaaf1810ed00035440.avif?t=1685540023\" /></div></td><td>Hold to <strong>Run</strong>, Tap to <strong>Pickup</strong>. Jump at max speed for a <strong>Super High Jump</strong>.</td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/f6585304a7f7beb21bd87dadff83f71f.avif?t=1685540023\" /></div></td><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/06372353c043a043944752ce2dc50816.avif?t=1685540023\" /></div></td><td>Press <strong>Start</strong> to pause then <strong>Select</strong> to quickly exit to main menu.</td></tr></table><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/b70be657b5995c34a57c77cc47175bf9.webp?t=1685540023\" /></div><br><table><tr><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/9161afd2c2c84d582c8f80a594221e60.avif?t=1685540023\" /></div></td><td><strong>Umbreller</strong> is a basic enemy, jump on their head to destroy them.</td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/e42ed940d57592a0a05148faec9d7ea1.avif?t=1685540023\" /></div></td><td><strong>Cloudum</strong> is similar to the Umbreller but can float in the air.</td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/b5a16c570d5b2987d6341763f04af3ae.avif?t=1685540023\" /></div></td><td><strong>Volcanog</strong> shoots drops of lava from its volcano, it's too hot to jump ontop.</td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/8500a4683f91527b8edf010cc9c3f863.avif?t=1685540023\" /></div></td><td><strong>Flitz</strong> is hot like the Volcanog, it flies in a wave pattern and  passes through walls.</td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/19a836fc87c9063ab39026118dc45519.avif?t=1685540023\" /></div></td><td><strong>Ball</strong> can be bounced upon but is too heavy to bounce off you.</td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/d85d8b5b9af02aa5069c1a3103e41cb0.avif?t=1685540023\" /></div></td><td><strong>Spinner</strong> spins two lines of lasers around it's center, but can be stood upon.</td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/875a793dcf483fcefaf97fa0c1a1b034.avif?t=1685540023\" /></div></td><td><strong>Death Block</strong> will instantly destroy you if collided directly.</td></tr></table><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/2ba72c495f749ecec371c397357d8667.webp?t=1685540023\" /></div><br><table><tr><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/be710593f613fe843474220c882282d5.avif?t=1685540023\" /></div></td><td>Diamonds and Keys are treated like a score, they must be collected in a single run.</td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/703419c1d79eba4d98c4c956e1a03b6b.avif?t=1685540023\" /></div></td><td>Diamonds and Keys can be collected separately from one another in different runs.</td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/0b0e0d3b03c8a85875e15c48ce6f51f8.avif?t=1685540023\" /></div></td><td>Course obstacles have multiple approaches, try different strategies.</td></tr></table>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/7b3ec08d0f719b35f03afa1eccb87480.webp?t=1685540023\" /></div><br>Super Nate Adventure is a game about focused, tight platforming through challenging levels. Each new level with a different obstacle than the last, encountering new areas and new enemies to face along the way. The game has <strong>12 levels</strong> that span across <strong>3 unique worlds</strong> which have different sceneries, music and obstacles. Diamonds are placed throughout the world to guide you through each level, but keys are an extra difficult challenge usually requiring more work to obtain.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/6aecaf014f69c0b73674cc1549921f9c.webp?t=1685540023\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Full controller support. Automatically detects connected controllers.</h2><br><br><table><tr><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/ac59f6a6a6965710496ed38ec82bf262.avif?t=1685540023\" /></div></td><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/841dfa0fe03b96f5c66a1c445a5bf485.avif?t=1685540023\" /></div></td><td>Press to <strong>Jump</strong> or hold for a <strong>High Jump</strong>.</td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/d082d80ccfef1729d3fc935e05af992c.avif?t=1685540023\" /></div></td><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/127c01a755c2dcfaaf1810ed00035440.avif?t=1685540023\" /></div></td><td>Hold to <strong>Run</strong>, Tap to <strong>Pickup</strong>. Jump at max speed for a <strong>Super High Jump</strong>.</td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/f6585304a7f7beb21bd87dadff83f71f.avif?t=1685540023\" /></div></td><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/06372353c043a043944752ce2dc50816.avif?t=1685540023\" /></div></td><td>Press <strong>Start</strong> to pause then <strong>Select</strong> to quickly exit to main menu.</td></tr></table><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/b70be657b5995c34a57c77cc47175bf9.webp?t=1685540023\" /></div><br><table><tr><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/9161afd2c2c84d582c8f80a594221e60.avif?t=1685540023\" /></div></td><td><strong>Umbreller</strong> is a basic enemy, jump on their head to destroy them.</td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/e42ed940d57592a0a05148faec9d7ea1.avif?t=1685540023\" /></div></td><td><strong>Cloudum</strong> is similar to the Umbreller but can float in the air.</td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/b5a16c570d5b2987d6341763f04af3ae.avif?t=1685540023\" /></div></td><td><strong>Volcanog</strong> shoots drops of lava from its volcano, it's too hot to jump ontop.</td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/8500a4683f91527b8edf010cc9c3f863.avif?t=1685540023\" /></div></td><td><strong>Flitz</strong> is hot like the Volcanog, it flies in a wave pattern and  passes through walls.</td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/19a836fc87c9063ab39026118dc45519.avif?t=1685540023\" /></div></td><td><strong>Ball</strong> can be bounced upon but is too heavy to bounce off you.</td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/d85d8b5b9af02aa5069c1a3103e41cb0.avif?t=1685540023\" /></div></td><td><strong>Spinner</strong> spins two lines of lasers around it's center, but can be stood upon.</td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/875a793dcf483fcefaf97fa0c1a1b034.avif?t=1685540023\" /></div></td><td><strong>Death Block</strong> will instantly destroy you if collided directly.</td></tr></table><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/2ba72c495f749ecec371c397357d8667.webp?t=1685540023\" /></div><br><table><tr><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/be710593f613fe843474220c882282d5.avif?t=1685540023\" /></div></td><td>Diamonds and Keys are treated like a score, they must be collected in a single run.</td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/703419c1d79eba4d98c4c956e1a03b6b.avif?t=1685540023\" /></div></td><td>Diamonds and Keys can be collected separately from one another in different runs.</td></tr><tr><td><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370250/extras/0b0e0d3b03